OL,5,G1100 Traffic Cops
OL,6,     FOfficers give high-speed pursuit
OL,7,     Fto a van with cloned plates which
OL,8,     Fsmashes through traffic near
OL,9,     FLeeds, and on the A1 a driver
OL,10,     Fclaims a mechanical fault caused
OL,11,     Fhim to crash.
OL,12,G1200 Traffic Cops
OL,13,     FIn North Yorkshire, more than
OL,14,     F1,000 drink drivers are arrested
OL,15,     Fevery year. On one busy road,
OL,16,     Fofficers search for a car
OL,17,     Freportedly swerving on a dual
OL,18,     Fcarriageway, and set a trap.
